  "title": "Arugula Salad with Avocado Citrus Vinaigrette",
  "description": "Here&#39;s a beautiful salad for that winter-into-spring season when the baby arugula leaves are so tender. A homemade avocado-citrus vinaigrette tops this flavorful salad, which contains Greek-style olives and shaved Parmesan cheese.",
